10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§4.3, p. 84; scan 92; local recursive yield construction"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=(D,\\ell)\">\\(t=(D,\\ell)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(t,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(t,A)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5156102396088b66\" href=\"?note=5156102396088b66\" title=\"73-df-cfg-parse-tree\">73-df-cfg-parse-tree</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\">\\(Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\)</span>；序列串接沿用该定义的词接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{YieldMap}_t(Y)\\leftrightarrow\\forall d\\in D\\;Y(d)=\\begin{cases}\\varepsilon,&amp;\\kappa_D(d)=0\\land\\ell(d)=\\varepsilon,\\\\\\langle\\ell(d)\\rangle,&amp;\\kappa_D(d)=0\\land\\ell(d)\\ne\\varepsilon,\\\\\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}Y(d\\langle i\\rangle),&amp;\\kappa_D(d)&gt;0.\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{YieldMap}_t(Y)\\leftrightarrow\\forall d\\in D\\;Y(d)=\\begin{cases}\\varepsilon,&amp;\\kappa_D(d)=0\\land\\ell(d)=\\varepsilon,\\\\\\langle\\ell(d)\\rangle,&amp;\\kappa_D(d)=0\\land\\ell(d)\\ne\\varepsilon,\\\\\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}Y(d\\langle i\\rangle),&amp;\\kappa_D(d)&gt;0.\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\n\\exists!Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\\operatorname{YieldMap}_t(Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\n\\exists!Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\\operatorname{YieldMap}_t(Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\nY_t\\coloneqq\\{(d,u)\\in D\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*:\\exists Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;(\\operatorname{YieldMap}_t(Y)\\land Y(d)=u)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)\\coloneqq Y_t(\\varepsilon)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\nY_t\\coloneqq\\{(d,u)\\in D\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*:\\exists Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;(\\operatorname{YieldMap}_t(Y)\\land Y(d)=u)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)\\coloneqq Y_t(\\varepsilon)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompleteTree}_G(t,A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)\\in\\Sigma^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompleteTree}_G(t,A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)\\in\\Sigma^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对子树高度作有限递归，叶的三个分支互斥且覆盖；内部节点只调用严格更低的子树，所以产出映射存在唯一。Y_t 的图收集唯一产出映射在各节点的取值，故根点值是词而非单元素语言。完整性只在已声明的 A-树域上定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-parse-tree","status":"resolved","id":"5156102396088b66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-parse-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-parse-tree","status":"resolved","id":"5156102396088b66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$、$A\\in V$、$t=(D,\\ell)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(t,A)$，见 [[73-df-cfg-parse-tree]]。$d\\in D$，$Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$；序列串接沿用该定义的词接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t=(D,\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(t,A)","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{YieldMap}_t(Y)\\leftrightarrow\\forall d\\in D\\;Y(d)=\\begin{cases}\\varepsilon,&\\kappa_D(d)=0\\land\\ell(d)=\\varepsilon,\\\\\\langle\\ell(d)\\rangle,&\\kappa_D(d)=0\\land\\ell(d)\\ne\\varepsilon,\\\\\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}Y(d\\langle i\\rangle),&\\kappa_D(d)>0.\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\n\\exists!Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\\operatorname{YieldMap}_t(Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\nY_t\\coloneqq\\{(d,u)\\in D\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*:\\exists Y:D\\to(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;(\\operatorname{YieldMap}_t(Y)\\land Y(d)=u)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)\\coloneqq Y_t(\\varepsilon)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}yield}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompleteTree}_G(t,A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)\\in\\Sigma^*","display":true}],"bytes":2342,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-tree-yield]]"},{"id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$w\\in\\Sigma^*$，$L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$。树、产出、语言见 [[73-df-cfg-tree-yield]]、[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-tree-yield|推导树的产出与完整性]]"},{"id":"bc99cdeced2b42c3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$A\\in V$，$\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$。树与产出见 [[73-df-cfg-tree-yield]]，一般和最左推导见 [[73-df-cfg-derivation]]、[[73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation]]。"},{"id":"50d0cf46cc3d9450","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5156102396088b66"]}